virglrenderer: virglrenderer (GL renderer library based on virtio)
virglrenderer:
virglrenderer: The project enables a virtual 3D capable graphics card for virtual
virglrenderer: machines running inside qemu. The implementation of rendering for the
virglrenderer: card is done in the host system as part of qemu and is implemented
virglrenderer: purely on OpenGL, so rendering can be accelerated on any sufficiently
virglrenderer: capable card/driver combination. The project also consists of a
virglrenderer: complete Linux guest stack.
